1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,434
Have you ever wondered
why we can walk on two legs
or use our hands to do so

2
00:00:05,434 --> 00:00:07,434
many things?

3
00:00:07,434 --> 00:00:10,756
Let me tell you a story about
our journey through time!

4
00:00:10,756 --> 00:00:11,096
A long

5
00:00:11,096 --> 00:00:11,778
long time ago

6
00:00:11,778 --> 00:00:13,775
