becoming a bit smarter

14
00:00:27,250 --> 00:00:28,440
They became Homo habilis

15
00:00:28,440 --> 00:00:29,681
which means "handy person

16
00:00:29,681 --> 00:00:30,873
" Imagine always having a

17
00:00:30,873 --> 00:00:33,892
tool kit like when you build
blocks or solve puzzles

18
00:00:33,892 --> 00:00:35,387
They used stones as tools

19
00:00:35,387 --> 00:00:37,515
which helped them survive
in new ways

20
00:00:37,515 --> 00:00:39,515
Then came Homo erectus

21
00:00:39,515 --> 00:00:41,930
They had learned to stand
tall and straight

22
00:00:41,930 --> 00:00:43,743
just like you when you’re
showing

23
