24
00:00:45,743 --> 00:00:48,246
These clever ones
discovered how to use fire

25
00:00:48,246 --> 00:00:49,969
which kept them warm and
helped

26
00:00:49,969 --> 00:00:51,969
them cook food

27
00:00:51,969 --> 00:00:53,600
It was like having a cozy

28
00:00:53,600 --> 00:00:55,292
warm blanket in the winter!

29
00:00:55,292 --> 00:00:55,512
Now

30
00:00:55,512 --> 00:00:56,453
as it got colder

31
00:00:56,453 --> 00:00:59,216
