Neanderthals learned to
adapt

32
00:00:59,216 --> 00:01:01,935
Think about wearing a
winter coat to stay warm

33
00:01:01,935 --> 00:01:03,420
They lived during icy times

34
00:01:03,420 --> 00:01:04,427
