35
00:01:04,427 --> 00:01:05,859
and hunted big animals like

36
00:01:05,859 --> 00:01:07,859
mammoths!

37
00:01:07,859 --> 00:01:08,316
Eventually

38
00:01:08,316 --> 00:01:08,896
our ancestors

39
00:01:08,896 --> 00:01:09,683
