40
00:01:09,683 --> 00:01:09,974
emerged

41
00:01:09,974 --> 00:01:11,927
They brought creativity into
the picture

42
00:01:11,927 --> 00:01:13,596
painting stories on cave
walls like

43
00:01:13,596 --> 00:01:15,596
